  },
  {
    "id": 2022013110090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "えっと──\r\n撮影のときの感想とか……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201311/2022013110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013110100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あと、施設がオープンしたら\r\nぜひ遊びに来てくださいって……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201311/2022013110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013110110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "す、すごく嬉しいです……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201311/2022013110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013110120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……あ、そういえば……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201311/2022013110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013110130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "さっき、プロデューサーさん\r\n『まずはこれ』って言ってましたよね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201311/2022013110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013110140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "手紙の他にも、何かあるんでしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201311/2022013110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。ほら、施設のオープンは先だけど\r\n広告はもう掲載されてるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸の起用も話題になってるみたいで、\r\n施設への予約があちこちから来てるらしいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013110150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そうなんですか\r\nすごい……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201311/2022013110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、そのお礼のお菓子も届いてるんだ\r\n今、冷蔵庫から取ってくるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
